From 7f2039901472e0319ac0ab41886aff307e26bbdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reverb256 <reverb256@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 23:48:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add SDR brightness control via
 NV_PLANE_DEGAMMA_MULTIPLIER

Add per-output SDR brightness support for HDR-capable displays on
NVIDIA GPUs. Uses the NV_PLANE_DEGAMMA_MULTIPLIER DRM plane property
(32.32 fixed-point) as a hardware-accelerated brightness multiplier.

Changes:
- niri-config: Add sdr_brightness field to Output config
- niri-ipc: Add OutputAction::SdrBrightness variant
- tty.rs: Add NvBrightnessProps for detection/set/restore
- tty.rs: Apply brightness on surface creation, config change, resume
- niri.rs: Wire SdrBrightness IPC action to config

Usage:
  niri msg output hdmi-a-2 sdr-brightness 0.9
